+#### [Template Archive](https://github.com/accordproject/template-archive)
+> **Description:** Accord Project’s Template Archive is a large catalog of computable legal and clause templates. The README explains Cicero’s model of binding natural-language templates to data models and executable request/response logic, which is useful for repeatable contract generation, review, and workflow automation. GitHub shows 334 stars, JavaScript as the primary language family of the repo, and an Apache-2.0 license. The latest GitHub release is dated March 7, 2026. This is not a chatbot product; it is better understood as open legal engineering infrastructure for standard forms and smart contract templates.
+
