+
+> Best AI tools for lawyers 2026 is a GitHub-only, open source shortlist for legal teams that want contract review, legal research, OCR, privacy, and self-hosted AI workflows without proprietary SaaS lock-in. Every entry below points to a public GitHub repository, includes GitHub metadata, and is framed around concrete legal use cases such as clause extraction, searchable PDFs, transcript handling, citation parsing, and firm knowledge retrieval.
