+## Quality Bar
+
+- Prefer repositories with clear documentation.
+- Prefer actively maintained repositories.
+- If a category has fewer than 5 strong repos, keep the category honest instead of padding it with weak fits.
+- Do not submit forks unless the fork is the main active project.
+
+## Editorial Policy
+
+Maintainers may reject submissions that are:
+
+- Off-topic
+- Closed source
+- Mostly marketing pages
+- Inactive experiments with no usable documentation
+- Duplicate entries
+
+## Reporting Errors
+
+If stars, license, language, or activity dates are outdated, open a PR with the corrected GitHub-sourced metadata.
